    "disclosures": [
      {
        "id": "D1",
        "from": 1,
        "to": 1,
        "text": "第3章 蹲点是反派的必备技能",
        "channel": "author",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "D2",
        "from": 2,
        "to": 2,
        "text": "严正声明：本书出场角色均已满18岁！不存在任何未成年人！",
        "channel": "author",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "D3",
        "from": 4,
        "to": 4,
        "text": "反派为什么要去找茬魔法少女。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_VILLAIN",
          "R_MG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D4",
        "from": 5,
        "to": 5,
        "text": "苏天晴从厨房里端着一杯牛奶两片吐司面包走到简朴的餐桌上坐下，一边刷着原主人那已经把屏幕摔出裂纹的手机，脑子里一边思考着这个永恒的问题。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_ORIG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D6",
        "from": 6,
        "to": 6,
        "text": "毁灭世界？统治人类？还是说比这更高远的目标？",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_VILLAIN"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D7",
        "from": 7,
        "to": 7,
        "text": "苏天晴没有任何这些想法，这个世界也没有什么正式的反派组织；目标定得太高远肯定是会出问题的。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_WORLD",
          "R_VILLAIN"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D8",
        "from": 8,
        "to": 8,
        "text": "通过网络与身体苏天晴小姐的记忆，自己已经大致了解了这个世界的状况。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_ORIG",
          "R_WORLD"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D9",
        "from": 9,
        "to": 9,
        "text": "魔法少女与怪人怪兽是客观存在的。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_MG",
          "R_MONSTER"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D10",
        "from": 10,
        "to": 10,
        "text": "魔法少女们接受英雄协会的管辖委派，一边与怪人战斗一边作为偶像出镜；真实身份保密，但变身魔法少女后的样子广为人知，与怪人怪兽之间的战斗甚至成了另类的宣传方式。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_MG",
          "R_HERO_ASSOC",
          "R_MONSTER"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D11",
        "from": 11,
        "to": 11,
        "text": "苏天晴所在的蓉城，目前正好有一名活跃的魔法少女。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_RONGCHENG",
          "R_MG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D12",
        "from": 14,
        "to": 14,
        "text": "想当反派去故意找茬，必须提前了解对手，这才是身为反派的觉悟。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_VILLAIN"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D13",
        "from": 15,
        "to": 15,
        "text": "画面中天蓝色的少女与一只凶猛的怪兽在街心交战，招招到肉的攻击手段让苏天晴心中一紧，不禁看了一眼自己白皙娇嫩的手腕肌肤。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_FX",
          "R_MONSTER",
          "R_STQ"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D14",
        "from": 16,
        "to": 16,
        "text": "苏天晴呢喃念出她的代号“风信子”。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_FX"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D15",
        "from": 17,
        "to": 17,
        "text": "她能变出大剑砍掉怪兽的脑袋；苏天晴怀疑自己是否真的要去跟这种肉搏型魔法少女找茬。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_FX",
          "R_MONSTER",
          "R_STQ",
          "R_MG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D16",
        "from": 18,
        "to": 18,
        "text": "苏天晴对自己变身后的力量没有直观感受，但看自己细皮嫩肉的萝莉造型，绝不是能跟人贴身肉搏的模样。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_BODY"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D17",
        "from": 19,
        "to": 19,
        "text": "没有丁点头绪啊！",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "D18",
        "from": 21,
        "to": 21,
        "text": "这本书自我介绍为“墨丘利秘典”。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_BOOK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D19",
        "from": 22,
        "to": 22,
        "text": "苏天晴不知道它为什么突然就不会说话了，但觉得里面或许会有自己需要的情报也说不定。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "conjecture",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_BOOK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D20",
        "from": 24,
        "to": 24,
        "text": "【任务：夙愿】",
        "channel": "document",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_BOOK",
        "about": [
          "R_BOOK",
          "R_TASK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D21",
        "from": 25,
        "to": 25,
        "text": "【获得200名关注者】",
        "channel": "document",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_BOOK",
        "about": [
          "R_BOOK",
          "R_TASK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D22",
        "from": 26,
        "to": 26,
        "text": "【成为闪耀的魔法少女，让所有人记住你的名字，带着她的那份一起活下去吧。】",
        "channel": "document",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_BOOK",
        "about": [
          "R_BOOK",
          "R_TASK",
          "R_MG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D23",
        "from": 27,
        "to": 27,
        "text": "【奖励：500神典石】",
        "channel": "document",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_BOOK",
        "about": [
          "R_BOOK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D24",
        "from": 28,
        "to": 28,
        "text": "苏天晴觉得这任务沉重得像隔壁mygo片场来的。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_TASK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D25",
        "from": 31,
        "to": 31,
        "text": "【魔法少女风信子】",
        "channel": "document",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_BOOK",
        "about": [
          "R_BOOK",
          "R_FX"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D26",
        "from": 32,
        "to": 32,
        "text": "【新近活跃的魔法少女，擅长近战压制与肉搏，对魔法尚不熟练】",
        "channel": "document",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_BOOK",
        "about": [
          "R_BOOK",
          "R_FX",
          "R_MG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D27",
        "from": 33,
        "to": 33,
        "text": "【今晚蓉城市绿心公园将出现怪人，预测风信子将前往迎击】",
        "channel": "document",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_BOOK",
        "about": [
          "R_BOOK",
          "R_RONGCHENG",
          "R_GREEN_PARK",
          "R_MONSTER",
          "R_FX"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D28",
        "from": 34,
        "to": 34,
        "text": "你瞧，这不就来了吗。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_TASK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D29",
        "from": 36,
        "to": 36,
        "text": "自己住在蓉城东部，绿心公园在中心城区；坐地铁也要两个小时，提前去蹲点守候是最好的办法。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "plan",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_RONGCHENG",
          "R_GREEN_PARK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D30",
        "from": 37,
        "to": 37,
        "text": "自己报名就读的蓉城医学院后天才开学，自己有的是时间跟风信子耗。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "plan",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_COLLEGE",
          "R_FX"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D31",
        "from": 39,
        "to": 39,
        "text": "原本的苏天晴不是有钱人家，一介狐狐也没什么打工挣钱的本事，平时在网上写写小说挣饭钱，衣柜单薄但仍有不少亮眼搭配。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_ORIG",
          "R_STQ"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D32",
        "from": 40,
        "to": 40,
        "text": "果然，爷真是世界第一可爱。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D33",
        "from": 44,
        "to": 44,
        "text": "苏天晴把十字星与古书塞进挎包，坐在角落里无视旁人目光，摸出手机继续查阅风信子的消息。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_CROSS_STAR",
          "R_BOOK",
          "R_FX"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D34",
        "from": 45,
        "to": 45,
        "text": "兽人在蓉城并不少见，人们只是稍微多看一眼便见惯不怪。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_BEASTFOLK",
          "R_RONGCHENG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D35",
        "from": 47,
        "to": 47,
        "text": "“叮咚。天府广场到了，换乘一号线的旅客请抓紧时间下车……”",
        "channel": "voice",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "D36",
        "from": 51,
        "to": 51,
        "text": "绿心公园是蓉城最大的湿地公园，人气很旺，是蓉城的一处地标公园。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_GREEN_PARK",
          "R_RONGCHENG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D37",
        "from": 58,
        "to": 58,
        "text": "苏天晴一边翻看墨丘利秘典，一边结合手机搜索到的消息，对这个世界与“自己”有了崭新的认识。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_BOOK",
          "R_WORLD"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D38",
        "from": 59,
        "to": 59,
        "text": "曾经的苏天晴小姐虽然长得可爱，但社恐孤僻让她极少出门；像自己这样坐两小时地铁到市中心，已算她半年以来出过最远的远门。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_ORIG",
          "R_STQ"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D39",
        "from": 60,
        "to": 60,
        "text": "来自兽人互助会的资助有限，加上她写小说功力不怎么样，只靠全勤勉强混饭吃，成绩一塌糊涂。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "R_ORIG",
          "R_BEAST_AID"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D40",
        "from": 61,
        "to": 61,
        "text": "写小说死路一条。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_ORIG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D41",
        "from": 62,
        "to": 62,
        "text": "看着银行账户里捉襟见肘的存款与学费贷款，狐狐深感痛心。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D42",
        "from": 63,
        "to": 63,
        "text": "“放心吧苏天晴小姐，既然我已经成为了你，那我就一定会让你过上更美好的生活！”小狐狸在心中暗自说道。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "promise",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_ORIG",
          "R_STQ"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D43",
        "from": 67,
        "to": 67,
        "text": "苏天晴思考关注者是什么意思，是不是粉丝；如果这就是原身的夙愿，实现起来未免太简单了。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_TASK",
          "R_ORIG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D44",
        "from": 68,
        "to": 68,
        "text": "以这个颜值，随便自拍几张发到小蓝书上都能随随便便混个千八百关注，用不着担心。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "conjecture",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D45",
        "from": 71,
        "to": 71,
        "text": "前摄被摔坏了，自拍的想法还是暂时打消吧。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D46",
        "from": 77,
        "to": 77,
        "text": "无论前世还是现在，自己仍是孤身一人啊。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D47",
        "from": 79,
        "to": 79,
        "text": "刷了一天视频有点累了，该把注意力放到正事上。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "plan",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D48",
        "from": 83,
        "to": 83,
        "text": "秘典上说的没错，今晚的确有怪人袭击绿心公园。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_BOOK",
          "R_MONSTER",
          "R_GREEN_PARK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D49",
        "from": 84,
        "to": 84,
        "text": "不对，我紧张什么，我不是反派吗；该紧张的应该是马上要到这边来的风信子才对吧。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_STQ",
          "R_VILLAIN",
          "R_FX"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D50",
        "from": 86,
        "to": 86,
        "text": "“快来吧，风信子。”",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "request",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_FX"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D51",
        "from": 87,
        "to": 87,
        "text": "“我可是给你准备了一份——美妙的见面礼哦。”",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "promise",
        "holder": "R_STQ",
        "about": [
          "R_FX"
        ]
      }
